DDA9 DD00             (    forth6809.asm):02565                  STD   STATE     ; below, running on EVERY line - including
                      (    forth6809.asm):02566                                   ; lines in the middle of a colon definition
                      (    forth6809.asm):02567                                   ; that spans more than one line of input.
                      (    forth6809.asm):02568                                   ; COLON (sets STATE=-1) and SEMI (sets
                      (    forth6809.asm):02569                                   ; STATE=0, after checking CSP) are the
                      (    forth6809.asm):02570                                   ; correct, sole places STATE should change
                      (    forth6809.asm):02571                                   ; during normal operation - the old QLOOP
