                      (    forth6809.asm):02573                                   ; silently dropped back to interpret mode
                      (    forth6809.asm):02574                                   ; every time QUERY read a new line,
                      (    forth6809.asm):02575                                   ; regardless of whether ";" had actually
                      (    forth6809.asm):02576                                   ; been reached. A colon definition split
                      (    forth6809.asm):02577                                   ; across multiple lines would have every
                      (    forth6809.asm):02578                                   ; word on every line after the first
                      (    forth6809.asm):02579                                   ; interpreted (and, for anything with a
                      (    forth6809.asm):02580                                   ; stack effect, executed) instead of
                      (    forth6809.asm):02581                                   ; compiled - "TRUE" pushing TRUEV onto the
