E462 DC76             (    forth6809.asm):03677                   LDD   UDLO
E464 3606             (    forth6809.asm):03678                   PSHU  D
E466 CCFFFF           (    forth6809.asm):03679                   LDD   #-1
E469 3606             (    forth6809.asm):03680                   PSHU  D
