F78A                  (    forth6809.asm):06670         SUBSTITUTEW: ; REWRITE: was a plain substring search-and-replace on
                      (    forth6809.asm):06671                      ; the bare registered name (via SEARCHW), which found
                      (    forth6809.asm):06672                      ; "girl" and replaced only that span, leaving surrounding
                      (    forth6809.asm):06673                      ; "%...%" delimiters untouched in the output - and never
                      (    forth6809.asm):06674                      ; returned the substitution count ANS requires as a
                      (    forth6809.asm):06675                      ; third stack item. Per the ANS spec (forth-standard.org/
                      (    forth6809.asm):06676                      ; standard/string/SUBSTITUTE), SUBSTITUTE must scan for
                      (    forth6809.asm):06677                      ; text between '%' (ASCII $25) delimiter pairs
                      (    forth6809.asm):06678                      ; specifically: "%%" collapses to a single '%' (count
                      (    forth6809.asm):06679                      ; unchanged); a name matching the REPLACES registration
                      (    forth6809.asm):06680                      ; has the ENTIRE "%name%" span - delimiters included -
                      (    forth6809.asm):06681                      ; replaced by the substitution text (count incremented);
