                      (    forth6809.asm):06917                                  ; MAME: a direct, standalone use of SIGN (not
                      (    forth6809.asm):06918                                  ; preceded by an unrelated flag-setting
                      (    forth6809.asm):06919                                  ; instruction) never added the minus sign for
                      (    forth6809.asm):06920                                  ; either sign of input.
