                      (    forth6809.asm):07437                                      ; is returned by PAD") - PAD's own region,
                      (    forth6809.asm):07438                                      ; growing upward from PAD itself, distinct
                      (    forth6809.asm):07439                                      ; from HOLDMINSIZE above (which answers
                      (    forth6809.asm):07440                                      ; for a different region entirely, the
                      (    forth6809.asm):07441                                      ; downward-growing pictured-numeric buffer
