                      (    forth6809.asm):07443                                      ; happens to equal PADMINSIZE numerically
                      (    forth6809.asm):07444                                      ; in this implementation (PADOFFSET EQU
                      (    forth6809.asm):07445                                      ; PADMINSIZE), but /PAD is answered with
                      (    forth6809.asm):07446                                      ; the conceptually correct constant, not
                      (    forth6809.asm):07447                                      ; the coincidentally-equal one.
FC2D FC7A00070000     (    forth6809.asm):07448                  FDB   EN9,EN9L,0    ; NEW: FLOORED - previously the one item
                      (    forth6809.asm):07449                                      ; in this area explicitly left open
                      (    forth6809.asm):07450                                      ; pending its own investigation (unlike
                      (    forth6809.asm):07451                                      ; WORDLISTS, this is a CORE query, not
                      (    forth6809.asm):07452                                      ; tied to an unimplemented optional word
                      (    forth6809.asm):07453                                      ; set, so "false by omission" wasn't the
                      (    forth6809.asm):07454                                      ; right default). Investigated by tracing
                      (    forth6809.asm):07455                                      ; DIVCOMMON (shared by /, MOD, /MOD)
                      (    forth6809.asm):07456                                      ; against this system's own SM/REM and
                      (    forth6809.asm):07457                                      ; FM/MOD: DIVCOMMON restores the
                      (    forth6809.asm):07458                                      ; remainder's sign from DNSIGN (the
                      (    forth6809.asm):07459                                      ; dividend's own original sign) after
                      (    forth6809.asm):07460                                      ; dividing absolute values - exactly
                      (    forth6809.asm):07461                                      ; SM/REM's own logic, confirmed identical
                      (    forth6809.asm):07462                                      ; by direct comparison. FM/MOD, by
                      (    forth6809.asm):07463                                      ; contrast, has an explicit flooring
                      (    forth6809.asm):07464                                      ; adjustment step (correcting the
                      (    forth6809.asm):07465                                      ; quotient and remainder when the
                      (    forth6809.asm):07466                                      ; quotient would be negative with a
                      (    forth6809.asm):07467                                      ; nonzero remainder) that DIVCOMMON does
                      (    forth6809.asm):07468                                      ; not have. This system's primary
                      (    forth6809.asm):07469                                      ; division words (/, MOD, /MOD) use
                      (    forth6809.asm):07470                                      ; symmetric division, not floored -
                      (    forth6809.asm):07471                                      ; FLOORED is 0 (false), a real, meaningful
                      (    forth6809.asm):07472                                      ; answer (recognized query, value false),
                      (    forth6809.asm):07473                                      ; not the "unrecognized" fallthrough
                      (    forth6809.asm):07474                                      ; WORDLISTS correctly uses.
